{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Should the survey focus on one product category, such as furniture or skincare, instead of any considered purchase?","Which research channels matter to your marketing plan, and are they all in the list?","Which deciding factors do you suspect matter most, and are you ready to be wrong?","Which background details, like age or location, will you actually use to compare groups?"],"howToUseResponses":"Group the answers by trigger first, since people replacing something that broke shop very differently from people who were inspired by an ad. Within each group, look at which research channels were used and how the deciding factors were ranked. The answers about what people would do differently are often the best source of messaging, because they describe the doubt your marketing needs to answer.","customizeSteps":["Narrow the first question to your category if you only care about one, for example the last piece of furniture someone bought.","Edit the research channels and deciding factors to match the ways people shop in your market.","Share the link with a panel or your audience, then filter by trigger in the dashboard or export to CSV for deeper analysis."],"faqs":[{"q":"What is a consumer behavior survey?","a":"It asks people how they actually find, compare, choose and buy products. The aim is to understand the steps and influences behind a purchase, not just what people say they prefer."},{"q":"Why ask about one recent purchase instead of shopping in general?","a":"A specific, recent purchase is easier to remember accurately. It gives you concrete steps and influences that broad questions about habits tend to blur."},{"q":"What questions should a consumer behavior survey ask?","a":"Ask what triggered the purchase, where the person researched, how many options they compared, what decided it, where they bought and how they feel about it now."},{"q":"Can I change it to focus on my product category?","a":"Yes. Edit the first question to name your category and adjust the channel and factor lists to fit. Every question can be edited after you copy the template."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Consumer behavior","description":"Understand real buying decisions by asking about one recent purchase.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_consumer00","ref":"welcome","title":"We're studying how people make buying decisions. Think of one recent purchase and we'll walk through it together.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_consumer01","ref":"item","title":"Think of the last thing you bought that took some thought, not an everyday top-up. What was it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":150},{"id":"blk_consumer02","ref":"when","title":"When did you buy it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_in_the_last","label":"In the last week","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_in_the_last_2","label":"In the last month","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_1_3_months","label":"1–3 months ago","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_longer_ago","label":"Longer ago","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_consumer03","ref":"trigger","title":"What made you start looking?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_something_broke_or","label":"Something broke or ran out","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_new_need","label":"A new need or a change in my life","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_an_ad_or","label":"An ad or a post I saw","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_someone_recommended_it","label":"Someone recommended it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_sale_or","label":"A sale or discount","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_just_wanted","label":"I just wanted to treat myself","image_key":null}],"allowOther":true},{"id":"blk_consumer04","ref":"research","title":"Where did you look before deciding?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_search_engines","label":"Search engines","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_review_sites_or","label":"Review sites or ratings","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_social_media_or","label":"Social media or videos","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_friends_or_family","label":"Friends or family","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_the_brand_s","label":"The brand's own website","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_in_a_shop","label":"In a shop","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_didn_t","label":"I didn't look around","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":10,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_consumer05","ref":"options_compared","title":"How many options did you seriously consider?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_just_the_one","label":"Just the one I bought","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_2_or_3","label":"2 or 3","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_4_or_more","label":"4 or more","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_consumer06","ref":"deciding_factors","title":"Put these in order of how much they decided it for you.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"ranking","items":[{"id":"opt_item_price","label":"Price"},{"id":"opt_item_quality","label":"Quality"},{"id":"opt_item_a_brand","label":"A brand I trust"},{"id":"opt_item_reviews","label":"Reviews"},{"id":"opt_item_delivery_or","label":"Delivery or availability"},{"id":"opt_item_a_recommendation","label":"A recommendation"}]},{"id":"blk_consumer07","ref":"where_bought","title":"Where did you buy it in the end?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_a_large_online","label":"A large o